  <p>Google's Display &amp; Video 360 help counts a view after 10 seconds of autoplay or a click. In practice the product, and whatever the ad is asking for, belong in those first 10 seconds.</p>

  <h2>How do Shorts compare with Reels and TikTok?</h2>

